"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4634400","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-1846651706688151","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"announcement","title":"Portabellows will be in this October Next Fest!","summary":"🎮Play our demo for a taste: figure out how to bake your very first pie 🥧, explore every corner to discover yummy ingredients, abilities and plane pieces!Our Demo is up here, we did a few updates thanks to your feedback!Looking forward to even more feedback from Next Fest which will directly improve our full game! Progress is going amazing as we're tweaking the full experience and having fun along the way.🎉Enjoy the fest! I hope you find gems that are fully your jam!~ Nance and Phred 💖","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:03:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-1846018067927471","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"update","title":"Release date update : A short but needed delay","summary":"Hi everybody, We made the decision to move our release date to the 20th of January 2027. We’re sorry we won't be able to make our original November 12th date, we were really excited to release it then!We’ve been debating pushing the date for a while and decided that prioritizing health and a good launch is better than sticking with our original date. Life happens and in our case it's an important surgery of an unknown date in a 2 month window that requires recovery time. Didn't want to release a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T20:16:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927471","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-1836506165552287","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes 1.0.2","summary":"Summary: This patch focuses on introducing the story of the demo, reducing motion sickness, adding more charm, improving using the map, and making sure you get the right quality setup automatically, specially when it comes to the Steam deck!⚠️Save progress warning ⚠️: if you had already placed the pie disk on the altar, you'll have to restart your save to bake the pie. This update also fixes some missing learned tutorials, so a fresh start is bestOnboardingAdded a slight visual + text story intr","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T00:53:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165552287","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-1835236783564932","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"update","title":"Demo v1.0.1 Patch notes : flow improvements, upgrades and fixes","summary":"Thanks so much for playing our demo! 💗Your feedback has been incredibly helpful and allowed us revamp the onboarding and improve the overall flow of the demo so you can have a better time :).NOTES: If you get motion sickness, you can change the rotation assist to \"None\" in the settings screen!The demo is fully playable with mouse and keyboard, though the gamepad is preferred🗺️ Onboarding improvements:Map is acquired earlier and unmissable for improved guidance🎮User experience (UX) improvementsMo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T23:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783564932","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-1834602721188956","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"announcement","title":"Collect away and bake a pie: Portabellows' Demo Available Now!","summary":"Incredibly excited to announce that our Demo is officially live and ready to play 🎉!! So happy to finally get a taste of the adventure in your hands!The Demo ExperienceThe demo starts later in the game so you get to enjoy a pie slice of the adventure that is Portabellows:Find a pie recipeFind the crashed pilot and retrieving some of his plane partsCollect to your heart's desire and what you need: fruits, jellybeans, and some abilitiesFigure out how to bake a pie and some early mysterious signs a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-04T23:03:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721188956","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-1807332909520868","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"announcement","title":"Portabellows will be part of the Wholesome Games Celebration 🎉","summary":"So excited and thankful to be included in the Wholesome Games Celebration in the \"Upcoming\" section ❤️!! Can't wait to see all the curated wholesome games next week ☺️The event will be live at https://store.steampowered.com/sale/wholesomegames on August 7th and lasts until the 14th!Latest UpdateWe're working hard on the game and Demo 😁Can't wait to share more!~ Nance and Phred","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-06T00:44:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1807332909520868","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-1783238125228151","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"announcement","title":"We have pies in our game!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43959626/336a97eb4f9231b2c63f3c3cc08ef934367671a5.jpg See any of our socials for a video of the pie roundups! 👉 Instagram video 👉 TikTok video 👉 YouTube video 👉 BlueSky We've been making a lot of progress on the pie making and having fun creating pies! - Nance","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-14T23:49:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1783238125228151","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2339000-6211118320231647255","game_id":"steam-2339000","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet our pilot NPC in this short animation clip!","summary":"We're now both full-time on Portabellows and couldn't be happier about it! We're happy to share a sneak peak at our pilot NPC character. https://youtu.be/bCOpyewA0Ig For more fun updates, follow us on these links in \"More Ways To Connect:\"","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-12T20:15:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6211118320231647255","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2339000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2339000":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2339000":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z"},"4634400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:53:12Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2339000","app_id":233900